  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "dsh-gitkit",
      "text": "Structured Git tools for DeepSeek Harness — an own-built replacement for\nthird-party git plugins. No bare-shell git calls: every command goes through\n`child_process.execFile('git', args)` with path validation (no absolute\npaths, no `..` traversal, no shell metacharacters)."
    },
    {
      "section": "Tools",
      "text": "- `git_status` — working tree status (porcelain), optional path filter\n- `git_diff` — diff of working tree or between refs (`--stat` or full)\n- `git_log` — recent commits (count, optional path filter)\n- `git_commit` — commit staged changes with validated message\n- `git_branch` — list branches / current branch"
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "```\ndsh plugin --profile web add file:~/dsh-own-plugins/dsh-gitkit\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "License",
      "text": "MIT"
    }
